  "html": "<p>感謝所有參加本場說明會的嘉賓，歡迎 12/1 踴躍上網報名。</p>\n<p><strong>EMRD 113 學年度報名資訊</strong> ( 入學時間為 2024 年 9 月 )</p>\n<p>報名時間：112 年 12 月 1 日 (五) 09:00 起至 112 年 12 月 15 日 (五) 17:00 止</p>\n<p>報名方式：一律網路報名及上傳審查資料</p>\n<p>報名簡章：<a href=\"https://www.admission.ntust.edu.tw/var/file/52/1052/img/2675/465922307.pdf?fbclid=IwAR0X9Dc774E_MiS7Fu1QKpQ7wHz_Ep4tNw3Qwm2Mh9rLRt4RelqUTPnQ2mk\">https://www.admission.ntust.edu.tw/....../2675/465922307.pdf</a></p>\n<p>網路報名網址：<a href=\"https://www.ntust.edu.tw/113entry2?fbclid=IwAR3hYIAxysEZgZdzNjKZUmBlnZc_IwL1VnUtwwr194QuWsImrMap6dVSlCY\">https://www.ntust.edu.tw/113entry2</a> (112/12/01 09:00 開放)</p>\n<p>招生常見 Q&amp;A：<a href=\"/admissions/info\">https://emrd.ntust.edu.tw/p/404-1039-107225.php?Lang=zh-tw</a></p>\n<p>更多招生資訊：<a href=\"/admissions/info\">https://emrd.ntust.edu.tw/p/404-1039-76505.php?Lang=zh-tw</a></p>\n<p>歡迎有志報考者加入由 EMRD 校友會所建立的 <u>EMRD 113 報名群組</u>，在報考過程中，EMRD 校友會幹部將提供協助，以解決各位可能遇到的問題。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"135\" src=\"/legacy/img/3d74a33c0e-665575595.jpg\" width=\"130\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 113 報名群組</p>\n<p><strong>招生說明會活動照片集錦</strong></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/5d167f71ee-278182920.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/f1d7009f3f-687417251.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>113 學年度招生說明會&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;113 學年度招生說明會</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/e04550ed14-908826499.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/cf9f4778b4-765769739.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 游進陽執行長&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; EMRD 鄭逸琳副執行長</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/9719e6df31-270956594.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/9340a29fa7-829421362.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>SEMI-EMRD 邱昱誠執行長&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;EMRD 校友會吳欽文理事長</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/bfbe3aa82e-401539090.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/b7ecee7d7a-170476635.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 校友會李定為副理事長&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;EMRD 張兆明校友</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/2fbad470a1-418533973.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/5a0da75a58-854602904.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/94c4639792-211242768.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/7f58a09e16-719952370.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/44eafe7860-362762052.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/19acd431f4-106907458.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/1672f323d6-518473455.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/380d9eb665-842885204.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>",
